<title>PHILIPPINES: Mabuhay Vinyl debuts at 2.18 pesos.</title>
<headline>Mabuhay Vinyl debuts at 2.18 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mabuhay Vinyl Corp made a debut on the Philippine Stock Exchange on Wednesday at a price of 2.18 pesos, up from the initial public offer (IPO) price of 1.90 pesos, brokers said.</p>
<p>Mabuhay Vinyl is a manufacturer of caustic soda and polyvinyl chloride resin.</p>
